BEGIN:VEVENT
CATEGORIES:History
DESCRIPTION:Remember how parents used to raise us with more freedom and a 
 lot fewer rules? From babies suspended in window cages and kids bouncing 
 in the backs of pickup trucks\, to expectant mothers being encouraged to 
 smoke\, drink\, and relax\, the parenting playbook once looked very diffe
 rent. It's an eye-opening\, head-shaking trip back to the parenting pract
 ices that prove what didn't hurt us made us stronger and our hazardous hi
 story was one for the ages.
DTEND:20260810T014200Z
DTSTAMP:20260815T011101Z
DTSTART:20260810T010000Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:TENTATIVE
SUMMARY:Hazardous History with Henry Winkler - 2x16 - Precarious Parenting
UID:NzbDrone_episode_41563
END:VEVENT
