BEGIN:VEVENT
CATEGORIES:History
DESCRIPTION:Remember when feeling better sometimes meant taking your medic
 ine... and your chances? From miracle snake oils that claimed to cure jus
 t about every complaint\, to electrified healing devices that swore to re
 store perfect health\, to toxic tonics laced with strychnine and mercury\
 , yesterday's remedies often carried risks as remarkable as their promise
 s. These are the cures and questionable treatments that offered hope to g
 enerations of patients\, along with a host of unexpected side effects.
